  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"代理商-财务管理\",\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"代理商\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"发起转账，支持大钱包与小钱包互转，1:N批量转账。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"cg_transfer.wallet_transfer.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1799669807408128\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能发起转账\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1799669807408128\",\"title\":\"资金共享-发起转账\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fbNJp2Y2\">发起转账，支持大钱包与小钱包互转，1:N批量转账</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201798939101866058%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-bsnGiCPB\" id=\"h346b9f0-bsnGiCPB\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-cfUcgTQ2\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/cg_transfer/wallet/transfer/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1799669807408128\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-2JbDrzuI\" id=\"h346b9f0-2JbDrzuI\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-IGAt4aDg\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ntUlWC6T\" id=\"h346b9f0-ntUlWC6T\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i7sfs7Yl\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8AO6uFPA\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-n4sFOT7a\" id=\"h346b9f0-n4sFOT7a\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DhvJ8fh6\">鉴权账户</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2cAjPuP4\">鉴权账户类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Ow7JF97q\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JC8vK1Dn\"><code>AD</code> 巨量客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uY7UczIv\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BmFWjFT5\"><code>LOCAL</code> 本地推客户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">biz_request_no</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-s5lbIqWd\">请求幂等id，同一biz_request_no发起转账代表同一转账申请，返回的转账单号相同，推荐uuid</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">main_wallet_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AaZT7Zxe\">申请转账的大钱包id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_wallet_detail_list</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bzOv01mb\">申请转账的小钱包列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">sub_wallet_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lL9p4zik\">申请转账的小钱包id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">transfer_capital_detail_list</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2M3dtqhm\">申请转账资金列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">capital_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-s56OuFzV\">资金类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-yigJqNs0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W6buYgy9\"><code>CREDIT_BIDDING</code> 授信竞价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1tWS0HO8\"><code>CREDIT_BRAND</code> 授信品牌</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZLOzNN1S\"><code>CREDIT_GENERAL</code> 授信通用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZRlASbeB\"><code>PREPAY_BIDDING</code> 预付竞价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Fc7AIm3a\"><code>PREPAY_BRAND</code> 预付品牌</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4ruRYCpx\"><code>PREPAY_GENERAL</code> 预付通用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">platform</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2R6AEkwS\">业务线 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-i5PQyNB6\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-B40siSOJ\"><code>AD</code> 营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PlyB3svy\"><code>AD_ALL</code> 营销通用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eOvmGm5b\"><code>BENDITUI</code> 本地推</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Z1trXFPB\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code> 千川</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-68qr72NK\"><code>STAR</code> 星图</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\